{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "798dbcd1bbe292ecea97bafc3251d410b339371b174af42d8648c7c57a854b12", "ja": "拝啓、劇場のみんなへ", "zh": "致剧场的大家", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8f6fac0c0e81b710da9c1d21c52793d043d21ad1cf1927c709788dfc00bc28ec", "ja": "秋葉原で会った新人アイドル候補生に刺激を\n受け、初心を取り戻した5人は、劇場の仲間\n達に手紙を書こうと提案する。自分達も\nみんなを応援したい、だって、応援される\n嬉しさは、よく知っているから。", "zh": "五人在秋叶原遇见新人偶像候补生，\n深受刺激后回忆起自己的初心，\n于是提议写信给剧场的伙伴们。\n她们也想声援大家，\n因为她们非常清楚获得声援的喜悦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6ede797c4aa2afb69e7f1f17841fb7c007bb78496612a4c9d95ebbec6a8874d1", "ja": "（さて、今日もレジェンドデイズのレッスン日\nなのだが……廊下までみんなの声が響いている）", "zh": "（今天也是『Legend Days』的练习日……\n大家的声音都传到走廊了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "9455322f302bdd201fc1e59842217b3c8365ab1f52edf2b5de13feb00da6d5d2", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！", "zh": "1、2、3、4！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "b0d0c2d3d67ebe708da9a0a03a886cdfa811e8421368235411c8e72e3bb42799", "ja": "亜美、顔がこわばってるわよ！\nアンタ、そんな顔でステージに立ちたいわけ？", "zh": "亚美，你的表情很僵硬！\n你想用那种表情站在舞台上吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "587cbe2518c08e2206ff54d273498f1dd89dc47796fa593d35784a4cfa2fc5f6", "ja": "わかってるってば！　むずかしいとこだから、\nぐぬぬってなっただけ。慣れればヘーキだよ！", "zh": "亚美知道啦！只是因为这一段很难，\n不小心用力过头，只要习惯就没事了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "2d4a80f6a45ed7de4fff6a6b19a07c185b4b57a40b48e36cff10cd2e776e44d5", "ja": "やよい、ターンのとこ、良くなったじゃない！\nでも、その次のところも注意して！", "zh": "弥生，你转圈的动作进步了嘛！\n但是，接下来的部分也要注意喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "0ddc4e5487da9494462e12c4b69b3439cf313921bbe930ee53c6395007cc2bd8", "ja": "はいっ！　もっともーっと練習して、\nババーンって、キメちゃいますーっ！", "zh": "好的！我会更更更──努力练习，\n跳得超──帅气的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "aba312a02974cedf138998fb86d7942fe3bfdca9ffe8fabd019a6e1097123af2", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。すごい気合いだな。\nドリンクの差し入れ、もってきたぞ！", "zh": "大家辛苦了，你们非常有干劲呢。\n我带饮料来慰劳大家啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "57127e4bee894545e5c1b5af91ac008392f14aba6df1e3b218be8a5a27b11302", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとね！\nよーし、みんな、いったん休憩にしようっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你！\n好──大家暂时休息一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "c841578fb8ae05fe79ae76f1ce4e1312f7c69f7aa602ccb49790ef09d8c9403b", "ja": "ふぅ、喉がかわいてたから、ありがたいです。\nさすが{$P$}殿、気がききますね！", "zh": "呼，我一直很渴，有得喝真是太好了。\n不愧是{$P$}阁下，真是机灵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5eefa300fb8d56f2320b62ac15c113a19c4f4978276922a725cdafdb41fc840a", "ja": "とんでもない。……それにしてもみんな、\n今日はいつもと気迫が違うんじゃないか？", "zh": "你过奖了……话说回来，\n今天大家的气势似乎非比寻常？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "459304407df5ef05b685bec62f1217d39dc3d0ea38796f92db55f3722c809f20", "ja": "えへへ……♪　さっき、みんなで話してたんです！\nあの女の子、すごかったね～って！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪刚才我们一起讨论过，\n觉得那个女孩子真厉害～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e6c8e91a1722dec6805c7ee9704efe6bddf91e46d25137eb2c2424a42ebfe48c", "ja": "秋葉原にいた、アイドル候補生の子か？", "zh": "你是说在秋叶原的偶像候补生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "7c6d967ddcf721979bab6c5d27f9778de826c1efcc77c0254b0a4d1a31535451", "ja": "正直レベルは低かったわよね？　私達に比べたら全然。\nでも……ずっと目を離せなかったわ。", "zh": "老实说，她的程度很差吧？完全比不上我们。\n但是……我的视线一直没办法移开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "f384f875cc5b9b9505b67856dd90b86b8640e69ce72c7ad91ddc42c5a7ad1878", "ja": "そうなんですっ。すっごく頑張ってて、楽しそうで、\nキラキラーって気持ちになりましたー！", "zh": "就是说啊。她看起来非常努力又开心，\n我看了以后觉得好耀眼──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "f6d6b207d403816e1b57a3e1179cc3439535f38730237dcee5d43fa4df47596b", "ja": "周りも、メッチャ盛り上がってたよね！\nあんな道のはしっこだったのに、うおおーって！", "zh": "观众的反应也超热烈对吧！\n明明是在路边，却一直喔喔喔地叫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "3b8e489a7e72fa714383fdd2c9b4caa190a7d288c45cb60e1c03260ea72aeb66", "ja": "あの子、全力で夢を見てる感じがしたぞ！\nだからファンも、全力で応援してたんじゃないかな！", "zh": "她给人一种用尽全力在追梦的感觉！\n所以粉丝也都在全力声援她吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "8eb21b65e05c591b7a357522451dff79533d8c11d3a82ab2b92d2e8631a31705", "ja": "私達も、アイドル候補生の頃はあんな感じでしたよね。\n……ふふっ、荒けずりで勢いだけでしたけど。", "zh": "我们还是偶像候补生的时候也是那样吧……\n呵呵，那时候我们空有气势，一点都不成熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "7f8fed73a6b0419f0a5366f21947504fea70cb0cb85103bf83c57c26b26c2919", "ja": "でも、夢見るパワーは、大盛り山盛りでしたよねっ！\n今だって、そうですっ！", "zh": "可是，我们那时候有好多好多力气追梦对不对！\n现在当然也还有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "a3d1736312f112cd29e9ccb1fadd65853c24d45f526ee9b3498cd36599f9714c", "ja": "アイドルを頑張りたいって気持ちとか、ファンのみんな\nにありがとうって気持ちとか、ずっと一緒かなーって！", "zh": "想努力当好偶像的心情，还有对粉丝的感激，\n这些一直都没有变──我想就是这样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "fb70cc33c5e057f1e8354ab6695d1711d18aa522b2617581738c285854b92bce", "ja": "ただ、最近ちょっと忘れてたのよね～。\n忙しかったり……あと、慣れちゃってたのかもね。", "zh": "不过，最近有点忘记那种感受了呢～\n因为很忙……还有，也可能是习惯了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "5df9da5103ca362da7ec81aea3146b8052916c59351a95a6404687783de56904", "ja": "それだったのよ、きっと。\n私達の探し物は。", "zh": "我们在找的，一定就是这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b053b3e873efb9d8d41a66599270b90bc2210f80d4403cfa935cb91557b08616", "ja": "足りないって感じてた何か、か？", "zh": "就是你们感觉有所欠缺的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "cb2aabdd4e919bb271ed48a19b3f29788e28681df064a69c0799ba16c64fa970", "ja": "そう、初心ってやつかしら。言葉にするとカンタン\nだけど、あるのとないのとじゃ全然違うわよね。", "zh": "没错，这叫做初心吧？说起来简单，\n但有没有这份初心，可是完全不一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "741a75e0b11b49f51f95de032938898163bbe88abc4c314a3bc4f931cd97677e", "ja": "技術も大事だけど、うまくこなすだけじゃ足りない。\n気持ちが見た目にも影響しますからね、歌もダンスも。", "zh": "技巧固然很重要，但只是学会技巧还不够。\n毕竟心境会影响外在，呈现在歌唱和舞蹈表现上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "4e7ce1a6cb63fd4f1b6a43c1ea44a1ce42910ba991f15720248bf90e0e07e472", "ja": "だから、私達の内なる情熱がちゃんと見えるような\nパフォーマンスをすべく、レッスンしてたところです！", "zh": "所以，我们刚才一直在练习，\n希望能在表演中展现出我们内心潜藏的热情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1025_011ami", "source_sha256": "71e9c6bb8dcdd739ad98ee744a6c9d30c3b6565a622cbd4f2ca6c384003cd682", "ja": "いやー、アイドル道ってもんは、じつにこう、\nヤマありタニありソラありですなぁ、兄ちゃん君！", "zh": "哎呀──所谓的偶像之路，实在是有起有落，\n还能飞上天呢，亲爱的大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "0a48097243076fbd8d165faed4c94abcb168e3b4a62de946915b8b92fb52f274", "ja": "こんな大事なコトに気づけるなんて……。亜美の\n言うとおり遊びにいって、本当に良かったよね♪", "zh": "能够发现这么重要的事情……\n真的幸好有听亚美的话出去玩对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c9165025c86b33c58c921d25a91c811b409b0275d83bf8869b7e8311d840f7c9", "ja": "そ、そうだな。ぜんぶ亜美のおかげみたいに\n言われると微妙だけど、まあいい。", "zh": "是、是啊。要说全都是托亚美的福，\n好像也不太对，但也没关系啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "3dbe9d932b7ba567917947d6bac259592b0fda126bc56758e12273e7faaa80e9", "ja": "それと……あの子を見てたら、思い浮かんだのよね。\n劇場の子たちのこと。", "zh": "还有……看到那个女孩后，\n我就想起剧场的偶像们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "521d1ab34a2b388da81bf980f662c48c98aaf062d5f3e9ad6dd5236f7be2301a", "ja": "あっ、私もだよ！　39プロジェクトのみんなと、\nちょっと似てたよね？　一生けん命な感じとか！", "zh": "啊，我也是！她们和39PROJECT的大家\n有点像对吧？比如那种拚命努力的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1030_007ior", "source_sha256": "3d96e3dfef031be24b88b84bee3cc7a0f0c4542d2e12c0ebf062e50263db994c", "ja": "あの子たちも、今の気持ちを忘れないで欲しいわね。\nたぶん、とっても大事なもの……なんでしょ？", "zh": "希望她们也不要忘记现在的心情。\n那应该是非常重要的东西……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "dfe8a3a47133e7d58f97299c8702d61166db64bdb75ef07a946f39cd97484f88", "ja": "もちろん、そうだと思う。\nさすが伊織だな。", "zh": "当然非常重要。\n真不愧是伊织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "b675f7b3d48f8e2ea33ba2f5e7abe602ddca2a507319c3a8cbffd7b2bca1f0cc", "ja": "べ、別に、心配してるとかじゃないわ。\n……ただのアドバイスよ、アドバイス！", "zh": "我、我才没有在担心她们……\n这只是一个建议罢了，建议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1033_011ami", "source_sha256": "6ed8dff9307d97188afac0e70767911b05ec1bfa4df981526b3064bfdaad4c49", "ja": "んっふっふ～、照れ屋さんですな～。\nヘイ、照れ焼き一兆！　もうてんこ盛りで！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～真是害羞的小姑娘啊～\n来，真羞美味一兆份！全部超大碗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "0201316d30b2ac9f9c107d2bd8182597cca418d4fa9fd00af95ce4f9c6fcee39", "ja": "う、うるさいわね！　違うって言ってるでしょ！", "zh": "吵、吵死了！我说了我没有吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1035_011ami", "source_sha256": "8f047a70a09102dab7d4f241b152762687728a48f6252fa617f98642e14c6d29", "ja": "いいからいいから～。そんじゃあさ、いおりん。\n劇場のみんなに、亜美たちで手紙を書こうよ！", "zh": "好啦好啦～那伊织儿，\n亚美我们来写信给剧场的大家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1036_007ior", "source_sha256": "ae8a20857cf67423e9d793a6e910ff30f880942e452cd4b8fe7fa830d61f7d60", "ja": "手紙～？", "zh": "写信～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1037_011ami", "source_sha256": "510b913b6a319a48d527a36ef45d3bd928e1b222197e682db86a534c4d975ecd", "ja": "うん、応援の手紙！　応援してもらうのって、\nうれしいっしょ？　気持ちがメキメキするっしょ？", "zh": "嗯，写信声援她们！有人声援自己不是会很高兴吗？\n然后初心就会突飞猛进吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "ae1584ead5e3b30b1358d9bb7000adb6375e81679b472128564435810d150269", "ja": "めき……？\nまあ、するかもしれないな。", "zh": "突飞猛进……？\n也许会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1039_011ami", "source_sha256": "3d89b4f2559592ab7729e1d1ab4b02f94cc24b1ecc1482a24e3d1f8fc8f6be36", "ja": "だから亜美たちも、がんばってほしい人のこと、\n応援するの！　劇場メキメキ大作戦だよ～！", "zh": "所以亚美我们也要声援希望她加油的人！\n这是剧场突飞猛进大作战喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1040_005yay", "source_sha256": "af351df2c58a2c7f0588c1edec4a91547fcfd7b710085befc307874d68864847", "ja": "わあ～、すっごくいいかも！　今の気持ちが\n大事だよってこととか、書けばいいんだよね！", "zh": "哇～感觉是个好点子耶！\n只要写「要珍惜现在的心情」这类的就可以了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1041_009rit", "source_sha256": "7b0f746091f91c49b2c06f21b0802174e2981bd03bdddc42e6aa5286610139e5", "ja": "ふふ、ちょっとだけ先に夢を見始めた私たちからの\nエール、ってわけね。グッドアイディアじゃない？", "zh": "呵呵，意思是让稍微领先她们一步追梦的我们\n去声援她们，是吧？这主意挺好的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1042_013hib", "source_sha256": "184cbea7fcd630c012ea3b846cf8bea6acb0249c21b2bff95e2e9242a0387be0", "ja": "うんっ、自分も賛成だぞ！\n{$P$}、手紙、書いていいよね？", "zh": "嗯，本人也赞成喔！\n{$P$}，我们可以写信吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_1043", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "当然可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4ada09339116070a6ecb9efb071d76dfc6bb381c762493dd4a40952358d7904a", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！　みんな喜ぶと思うぞ。\nじゃあ、さっそく準備してくるよ。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以！大家一定会很高兴。\n那我马上去帮你们准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_2001_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_2002_009rit", "source_sha256": "466808d58aa614255f8051419bddfa53b5c370ad9bb17385107bb5b439371120", "ja": "書き出しはちゃんとした方がいいわよね。\n「拝啓、劇場のみんなへ」……と。", "zh": "开头还是正式一点好了。\n「致剧场的大家」……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_2003_011ami", "source_sha256": "5cd1d39196c9963e451ea6bdca0e6e531ffecd9da48839d5b5ea43a4f9fa1229", "ja": "もっとフレンドリーな方がよくない？\n「イェイ♪　みんな～、元気に、しているかね～？」", "zh": "写得更亲切一点比较好吧？\n「耶♪大家～你们过得好吗～？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_2004_013hib", "source_sha256": "c2c1d2b67a3c9c230cc57b97301c02624644b704f9d4c383ab401ddab5affa9e", "ja": "「この前、みんなとよく似た女の子を、見ました」……\nうぎゃ～！　なんか変！　慣れてないから難しいぞ～！", "zh": "「我们之前看到了跟大家非常像的女生」……\n呜呀～！感觉好怪！本人不习惯写信，好难写喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_2005_005yay", "source_sha256": "55f5aa618bf4cf2321dbd632f212b1624ebcad1d46e777abe03a9c09936f3d65", "ja": "「それで、みんなのこと、おうえんしたくなって」……\n伊織ちゃん、おうえんって漢字、わかる！？", "zh": "「所以，我们想要声援大家」……\n伊织，你知道声援的国字怎么写吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_2006_007ior", "source_sha256": "25356d789340c82d06071f08405eff2fe07795c9036dfba4a2fe883b19896b25", "ja": "別に、ひらがなでもいいんじゃない？\n「みんな、伊織ちゃんについてきなさい！」っと……。", "zh": "直接写读音也没差吧？\n「大家快跟上伊织吧！」……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_2007_p", "source_sha256": "e9fd56611c0c9f39e7d336b2630153e0c7a7922626cf810d7520f1747b197d90", "ja": "（5人は楽しそうに、想いのこもった手紙をしたためて\nいく。きっと後輩たちの宝物になることだろう）", "zh": "（她们五人很开心地把心意写进信里，\n这一定会成为后辈们的宝物吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_04_2008_p", "source_sha256": "58f82e5125b648347836ad629431b4497eee10d5d5a39b7bb4ac835fbb8680ab", "ja": "（学んだことを、大切な誰かに伝えようとする……。\n自然とそこに行きつける時点で、立派な先輩だな！）", "zh": "（想要把学到的事情告诉重视的人……\n会自然而然这么做的时候，就已经是优秀的前辈了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
